    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"WeeklySummaryView-AboutThefeature\">About The feature</h2><p><span>The weekly summary view is a summary of the week’s load for each service. </span></p><h2 id=\"WeeklySummaryView-UsedBy\">Used By</h2><p><span>Can be used by anyone who is involved in scheduling appointments and managing Patient loads. This hopes to serve as a summary snapshot of the scheduled load of patients. Based on this users can choose to schedule more appointments or not. </span></p><h2 id=\"WeeklySummaryView-Howisitused\">How is it used</h2><ol><li>This View is the default landing page when the user accesses the appointment scheduling module. This view can be accessed anytime by clicking on the &quot;Summary&quot; Tab</li><li>The current week is displayed by default, with the current day highlighted. </li><li>Users can also use the date picker to select a week they choose to view. And can navigate to previous and next weeks.</li><li>Clicking on the count (blue) will take the user to a list of appointments filtered for that day and service in the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/299958294/List+View+of+Appointments\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299958294\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">list view</a>.</li><li>The missed appointments are shown in red. It cannot be clicked on. </li></ol><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border\" height=\"317\" width=\"929\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299958302/weekly-summary.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511536349096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=317\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/299958302/weekly-summary.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511536349096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299336020\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"weekly-summary.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"299958302\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"b528dab8-9ccc-4e6c-8a61-9b7860c27ecf\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299958302/weekly-summary.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511536349096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1007&amp;height=344 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/299958302/weekly-summary.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1511536349096&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=929&amp;height=317 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b990fe84-d166-442d-b1c9-a408bacfcd95\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>On This Page</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c7b7632d-e378-4c81-9d5f-ebaeced77f3d\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
